{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"67b7a6ce5c61e26df5c6bee16e41dcb848839a0de337625c59548f69b945b952","ja":"今日は『オペラセリア・煌輝座』の公演なのです！\nわんだほー！なステージにするのですよ♪","zh":"今天是《歌剧系列·煌辉座》的演出哦！  \n要把舞台变得精彩绝伦哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5c2d3b3d0483b14dac5dcfa32741f8bd27900db08d2893aae0847889560a27c7","ja":"公演の後には握手会もありますね。ファンの人達と\n触れ合えるこの機会を、大切にしたいです。","zh":"演出结束后还有握手会呢。我想珍惜这次与粉丝们交流的机会。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"24a24d651243b54a41f2b3ade13c0472acd9b45af9015239a4e21f429dac2d62","ja":"そうね。何度も公演に通ってくれる方達も\nいらっしゃるし、たくさん喜んでいただかないと♪","zh":"是呀，也有一遍遍来看演出的客人，所以一定要让大家尽情开心才行♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"96f51298ddbc345d9b4caeb39f7744e3484b416490a848d40c71bdf543e4d46c","ja":"ただ、せっかくの握手会を普通にやるのも\nつまらないのです。……もっとこう……こほん。","zh":"不过，难得举办一次握手会，要是就这么普通地进行，未免太无聊了。……应该再这样……咳咳。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0bb2b8f0985023e330f2cc7d274c758c286b6bde8d4a4d1eea6376b3a67584e7","ja":"「ふん、また会いに来るなんて、よほど\n僕の事が恋しかったと見えるな、アシュリー？」","zh":"「哼，看来你是想我想得不得了，才会又来见我啊，阿什莉？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9fa304fd2e00dce6a2fcbd2629d1500f3ac9c96ef137be761284cb6c03d6c055","ja":"えっと……なんですか、まつりさん。\n急にアリエルを演じたりして。","zh":"呃……怎么了，茉莉小姐。\n突然演起爱丽儿来了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"fba795086e96829f7df6111de028222656416ffce6d8ad6b42744cff6fa3dc5b","ja":"役になりきって握手したら、きっと喜んでもらえる\nのです！　志保ちゃん、キュンとしなかったのです？","zh":"要是完全进入角色去握手，对方肯定会很开心的！志保，你没有心动吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ccb0a25da0bec57fa09ded6cf8411247a65f4c9287144fa804e2b1659644d96d","ja":"かっこいいとは思いましたが、キュンとまでは。\n歌織さんは、どう思いますか？　……歌織さん？","zh":"虽然觉得很帅气，但还没到心动的程度。\n歌织小姐，你觉得呢？……歌织小姐？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_854.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2c1d228388a7dcf5dce52e5190165baaa39e5d419b712264a1408973e1548f66","ja":"「抜け駆けとは感心しないな。\n僕も、君の隣に……いいかな、アシュリー？」","zh":"抢先一步可不太好啊。我也想站在你身边……可以吗，阿什莉？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
